    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary mushroom who accidentally acquires the power of shadows from nowhere, allowing you to convert your attacks into shadows and then use them to fight back against enemies. Yes, mushrooms also have dreams, as the lowest species of &quot;XianDu&quot;, it has always been the fate of only to be eaten. Now, the roles are reversed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything must be done step by step, starting with the nearest JiuJiu forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter various &quot;JiuJiu&quot; here, and your Shadow power will also get various upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread spores everywhere, and end up filling the forest with mushrooms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary mushroom who accidentally acquires the power of shadows from nowhere, allowing you to convert your attacks into shadows and then use them to fight back against enemies. Yes, mushrooms also have dreams, as the lowest species of &quot;XianDu&quot;, it has always been the fate of only to be eaten. Now, the roles are reversed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything must be done step by step, starting with the nearest JiuJiu forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter various &quot;JiuJiu&quot; here, and your Shadow power will also get various upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread spores everywhere, and end up filling the forest with mushrooms.</p>",
